WEBVTT

00:00:01.490 --> 00:00:06.010
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.200
<i>Chikara to chikara butsukareba,
When power collides with power,</i>

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.790
<i>arasoi wa hajimaru.
wars start.</i>

00:00:19.470 --> 00:00:22.340
<i>Tatakau koto ga</i> yuuki <i>to</i>
I <i>don't think fighting</i>

00:00:22.340 --> 00:00:24.340
<i>omowanai kedo...
equals bravery, but...</i>

00:00:24.340 --> 00:00:26.740
<i>...mamoritai yo
...I want to protect</i>

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:29.300
kimi <i>no sono egao.
that smile on your face.</i>

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:34.920
<i>Asu e no geeto
We can't see the gate</i>

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:37.620
<i>mienai keredo...
to tomorrow, but...</i>

00:00:37.990 --> 00:00:41.390
<i>dare ni</i> demo <i>aru yo.
one's inside each of us.</i>

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:44.050
<i>Let's open the gate!</i>

00:00:45.630 --> 00:00:48.770
Kinou <i>no namida</i> wa
<i>The tears we shed yesterday</i>

00:00:48.770 --> 00:00:51.030
<i>kitto muda ja nai.
are probably not in vain.</i>

00:00:51.540 --> 00:00:55.410
<i>Arasoi no nai</i> mirai wa
<i>A future without war</i>

00:00:55.410 --> 00:00:59.170
<i>ano tobira no mukougawa.
waits behind that door.</i>

00:00:59.540 --> 00:01:02.310
Mune <i>no oku</i> fukaku
<i>Retrieve the key lying</i>

00:01:02.310 --> 00:01:06.250
<i>Jitto shimaikonda
deep inside your heart,</i>

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:09.050
<i>kagi wo takaku kakagete,
hold it up high,</i>

00:01:09.050 --> 00:01:11.290
<i>fumidasou!
and step out!</i>

00:01:11.290 --> 00:01:15.590
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:01:16.160 --> 00:01:22.120
<i>You can open the gate!</i>

00:01:40.470 --> 00:01:42.390
GATE...

00:01:42.570 --> 00:01:44.520
...OPEN!

00:01:44.770 --> 00:01:46.230
Arrow of light!

00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:48.660
Hustle, GO!

00:01:48.850 --> 00:01:51.580
Vacuous missile!!

00:01:55.920 --> 00:01:57.890
Bewitching Melo...

00:02:00.290 --> 00:02:01.850
Uh-oh.

00:02:01.930 --> 00:02:02.590
My god.

00:02:05.230 --> 00:02:07.060
Damn! Leave this to me!

00:02:07.130 --> 00:02:08.830
Hey, I can fight, too.

00:02:08.900 --> 00:02:09.870
Me, too, Ukiya!

00:02:09.940 --> 00:02:12.400
- Super Vacuous Ultra Missile! - 3
arrows of light! - Kaoru Kick!

00:02:12.470 --> 00:02:14.870
- Inner Circle throw! - lt's dangerous!
- One more!

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:16.840
Arrow of... Hey, Ukiya, move it!

00:02:16.910 --> 00:02:18.600
No, You're in my way, Rurippe!

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:19.910
Step this way, Ukiya.

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:23.640
I'm sorry, I'll have a new piano
delivered on the double.

00:02:33.930 --> 00:02:35.720
Is everyone assembled?

00:02:35.990 --> 00:02:38.260
You got it!
Yes, sir.

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:41.730
Chotaro Banba is first
to assemble, sir!

00:02:41.900 --> 00:02:44.270
Fortunately, you were able
to defeat them this time.

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:48.030
However, your fighting still needs
to be ironed out in many ways.

00:02:48.570 --> 00:02:50.040
That is why...!

00:02:51.280 --> 00:02:52.870
In order to establish
a chain of command...

00:02:52.950 --> 00:02:55.850
...l have decided to appoint a
captain of the Gate Keeper team!

00:02:56.350 --> 00:02:57.650
<i>Captain,</i>

00:02:57.720 --> 00:03:01.310
<i>I 'm already on the student council!</i>
I can 't be captain as well

00:03:02.190 --> 00:03:03.660
<i>Captain,</i>

00:03:03.720 --> 00:03:05.850
<i>I'm the captain?!</i>

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:09.950
<i>He wants me to keep everyone
in order with my brain strategy.</i>

00:03:10.030 --> 00:03:11.930
Excuse me...

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:14.930
...but don't you think that the
captain of the Gate Keepers...

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:18.370
...should be Ruriko who
was the first agent?

00:03:18.440 --> 00:03:22.670
O- Oh, please, Reiko.
I can't possibly be captain!

00:03:22.980 --> 00:03:25.910
You know! I'm already
on the student council...

00:03:25.980 --> 00:03:29.210
...the class, beautification,
and horticulture committees...

00:03:29.280 --> 00:03:32.840
...l'm also the blackboard monitor,
and I'm in charge of the class rabbit.

00:03:32.920 --> 00:03:35.680
- Then you can't!
-Well, it's not like I CAN'T...

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:37.620
I think Ukiya would
make a good captain!

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:38.180
Huh?!

00:03:38.460 --> 00:03:40.020
Wh- Who, me?!

00:03:40.160 --> 00:03:43.720
But, shucks! I'm not
the leadership type.

00:03:43.800 --> 00:03:46.460
You know! I'm only good
at rushing at the enemy.

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:48.160
That's true!

00:03:49.400 --> 00:03:52.030
U- Uh, I'd be thrilled
to be captain...

00:03:53.440 --> 00:03:56.700
When you think captain, you think
big boss! Captain equals Bancho!

00:03:56.780 --> 00:04:00.040
That settles it!!

00:04:00.310 --> 00:04:01.840
Ukiya is the captain!

00:04:02.050 --> 00:04:04.570
I guess it's all decided.

00:04:04.820 --> 00:04:07.650
But you know, Ukiya is
kind of a scatterbrain!

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:09.210
Well, excuse me.

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:12.280
What's this? You just said you
couldn't possibly be captain.

00:04:12.360 --> 00:04:15.730
Oh, I see. lkusawa, you actually
DO want to be captain, don't you!

00:04:15.790 --> 00:04:17.790
N- NO, I...

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:18.440
CAPTAIN

00:04:18.470 --> 00:04:22.160
When l, Chotaro Banba,
become captain...

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:24.700
...l will exert my utmost for peace!
I never indicated I wanted to become...

00:04:24.770 --> 00:04:28.300
Ukiya will be captain!
If... lf I become captain...

00:04:28.510 --> 00:04:30.130
Ahem!

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:34.770
The position of captain will be
settled by secret ballot next week!

00:04:35.780 --> 00:04:38.110
R- Roger, AEGIS!

00:04:46.160 --> 00:04:48.890
Gate Keeper Members Rule #1:

00:04:48.960 --> 00:04:51.090
Earth peace comes before
personal safety. Rule #2:

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:53.890
Do not talk about
Gate Keepers. Rule #3".

00:04:53.970 --> 00:04:55.930
...what was it again?

00:04:56.440 --> 00:04:58.670
Shut up, you big lug!

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:01.740
What are you doing
disturbing a guy's slumber?!

00:05:01.790 --> 00:05:02.770
You're noisy!

00:05:02.840 --> 00:05:04.310
What do you think you're doing?!

00:05:05.340 --> 00:05:08.370
<i>Honest/y! If one of
them becomes captain...</i>

00:05:08.450 --> 00:05:12.320
<i>...it will spell the end of the
Gate Keepers. I must do something.</i>

00:05:18.190 --> 00:05:19.660
Amazing!

00:05:19.720 --> 00:05:21.210
Kaoru is so cool!

00:05:24.430 --> 00:05:28.160
<i>How can I make Ukiya captain?</i>

00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:32.470
<i>Kaoru,
</i>If I become captain, you'll...

00:05:34.510 --> 00:05:37.440
IRON IVANJUMP!

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:50.820
...y- you'll be able
to jump even higher.

00:05:52.520 --> 00:05:53.990
Ow.

00:05:56.830 --> 00:05:58.260
Sumire Dormitory

00:06:00.870 --> 00:06:04.530
That was a great bath. Dorm baths
are big, so they feel really good.

00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:07.670
Oh!

00:06:08.370 --> 00:06:10.000
Good evening!

00:06:14.880 --> 00:06:16.350
Huh?

00:06:19.580 --> 00:06:22.050
What's their problem?!

00:06:22.490 --> 00:06:26.190
They don't have to be like that
just because I'm new here!

00:06:31.400 --> 00:06:33.760
I thoughtl heard someone...

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:36.800
What's wrong with this window?

00:06:38.200 --> 00:06:40.000
Is this window covered?

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:54.250
What was that?

00:06:54.320 --> 00:06:55.880
What?! What was that?

00:06:55.950 --> 00:07:00.690
I thoughtl heard a loud noise.
Where do you suppose it came from?

00:07:00.760 --> 00:07:02.850
I'm pretty sure...
it came from over here.

00:07:02.930 --> 00:07:05.920
Really? We can't see
anything through this.

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:08.520
Reiko, want to remove this seal?

00:07:08.600 --> 00:07:10.760
Huh? But do you think we should?

00:07:10.840 --> 00:07:13.860
It'll be fine. Nobody will
find out if we put it back later.

00:07:13.940 --> 00:07:15.930
Hey, you two.

00:07:16.010 --> 00:07:18.170
Sh- Shimamura...

00:07:18.240 --> 00:07:22.150
What are you doing, sneaking
around so late at night?

00:07:22.210 --> 00:07:26.240
Sneaking around? We heard
a loud noise from outside.

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:27.910
It went "bang."

00:07:27.990 --> 00:07:29.510
Didn't it!

00:07:29.590 --> 00:07:32.250
I didn't hear anything.

00:07:32.620 --> 00:07:33.820
But I'm sure I...

00:07:33.990 --> 00:07:36.050
I didn't hear anythingl!

00:07:38.030 --> 00:07:41.900
I'll take this opportunity to
give you the newcomers speech.

00:07:44.570 --> 00:07:48.600
Now, listen. You are not to enter
Room 104 under any circumstances!

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:50.530
What?!

00:07:50.610 --> 00:07:52.200
W- Why?

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:54.510
Because that room...

00:07:54.650 --> 00:07:57.510
...is the room that musn't be opened!

00:07:57.920 --> 00:07:59.580
The room that mustn't be opened?!

00:07:59.650 --> 00:08:01.520
But Why?!

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:06.450
You'll find out soon...
Very soon.

00:08:13.060 --> 00:08:14.530
The room that mustn't be opened?

00:08:14.600 --> 00:08:17.590
Yes!
Don't! I can't handle scary stories!

00:08:17.670 --> 00:08:20.760
And you two are the only
ones who heard the noise?

00:08:21.140 --> 00:08:22.970
That's right.

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:26.480
Everyone said they didn't hear anything
as though they were covering up something.

00:08:27.010 --> 00:08:29.610
And you're the only two who
sense something suspicious?

00:08:29.950 --> 00:08:31.680
That's right!

00:08:31.750 --> 00:08:33.650
In the first place,
there's something weird about that dorm!

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:37.620
It's in right angles, everyone is
unfriendly, and the mysterious room...

00:08:37.690 --> 00:08:40.090
...and a 2nd floor window
that you can't see through.

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:43.590
Two of the Gate Keeper
team are being targeted!

00:08:44.100 --> 00:08:47.000
This may be the work
of the invaders!

00:08:47.070 --> 00:08:48.660
Invaders?!

00:08:48.730 --> 00:08:51.700
Do you mean they're hiding
in Sumire Dormitory?!

00:08:52.070 --> 00:08:54.230
Are you suggesting the invaders
have become aware that...

00:08:54.310 --> 00:08:56.930
...the Far East branch of
AEGIS is in Tategami High?!

00:08:57.680 --> 00:08:59.640
It's a possibility.

00:09:00.050 --> 00:09:01.840
That can't be...

00:09:04.020 --> 00:09:06.710
<i>lf Ukiya were to
solve this case...</i>

00:09:08.320 --> 00:09:10.790
<i>...he would become
captain for sure!</i>

00:09:12.060 --> 00:09:14.580
<i>lf I were to solve this serious case...</i>

00:09:25.100 --> 00:09:26.730
<i>This is my chance!</i>

00:09:28.410 --> 00:09:30.340
Ukiya, hurry!

00:09:30.410 --> 00:09:32.070
W- Wait a minute...

00:09:32.140 --> 00:09:34.010
It's hard to walk in this thing!

00:09:34.080 --> 00:09:38.240
There's no other way. Boys aren't
permitted in the girls' dormitory.

00:09:39.380 --> 00:09:40.910
Yeah, but still...

00:09:40.990 --> 00:09:43.850
I want you to become captain, Ukiya!

00:09:44.160 --> 00:09:46.680
That's flattering, but...

00:09:46.760 --> 00:09:49.850
It's a little late to
be saying that. Besides...

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:52.360
...it looks pretty
good on you, Ukiya.

00:09:53.130 --> 00:09:54.760
That ISN'T flattering!

00:10:00.810 --> 00:10:02.570
Did you hear that?
Yes.

00:10:03.410 --> 00:10:05.070
Lucky Ukiya...

00:10:05.140 --> 00:10:06.700
Girls' dorm!

00:10:06.780 --> 00:10:11.050
To us boys, Sumire Dormitory
is like the forbidden garden!

00:10:11.120 --> 00:10:12.710
Megafie!
Huh?

00:10:12.820 --> 00:10:15.080
We're going in, too!!!

00:10:15.150 --> 00:10:17.320
To Su-mi-re Dorm!

00:10:17.390 --> 00:10:20.720
WHAT?! But if we're caught,
we'll get expelled!

00:10:20.790 --> 00:10:22.820
What are you talking about?!
We're doing it...

00:10:22.890 --> 00:10:25.060
...to clear up the strange
incident in Sumire Dorm!!

00:10:25.130 --> 00:10:28.330
l get it.
It's our duty, isn't it, Bancho!

00:10:28.400 --> 00:10:31.060
Damn straight!
It is all for the sake of world peace!

00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:36.570
I feel a lot safer with you
staying the night, Ruriko.

00:10:39.040 --> 00:10:40.700
What's wrong?

00:10:40.780 --> 00:10:43.180
I thought I just saw
someone over there.

00:10:43.250 --> 00:10:45.180
Oh, no, not again!

00:10:45.250 --> 00:10:48.080
It's been happening
a lot lately.

00:10:48.890 --> 00:10:51.520
I think there is something
to this after all.

00:10:58.900 --> 00:11:01.390
This is Room 104.

00:11:03.170 --> 00:11:04.640
It is strange.

00:11:05.300 --> 00:11:08.140
This is the only door on the
opposite side of the hail...

00:11:08.210 --> 00:11:11.770
...and it's shaped differently.
This needs investigation.

00:11:11.840 --> 00:11:13.680
In- Investigation?

00:11:13.750 --> 00:11:15.770
We're going in!

00:11:15.850 --> 00:11:17.370
I was afraid you'd say that...!

00:11:17.450 --> 00:11:19.750
I think it's the fastest way.

00:11:19.820 --> 00:11:23.050
B- But, it's night now,
so can't it wait till morning?!

00:11:23.120 --> 00:11:24.590
You've got a point.

00:11:29.030 --> 00:11:30.460
You two!

00:11:30.530 --> 00:11:32.830
Sh- Shimamura...

00:11:32.900 --> 00:11:34.700
Please don't frighten us like that.

00:11:34.770 --> 00:11:37.760
What are you doing here?
Return to your room immediately.

00:11:38.300 --> 00:11:42.240
U- Um... Excuse me, but what
on earth is inside this room?

00:11:43.210 --> 00:11:45.400
You're Ruriko lkusawa from
the Grade 11 class, aren't you?

00:11:45.640 --> 00:11:46.470
Yes.

00:11:46.540 --> 00:11:50.570
That is a dorm matter. We would
appreciate you staying out of it.

00:11:50.650 --> 00:11:52.120
But...

00:11:53.890 --> 00:11:55.350
I just saw some kind of light!

00:11:56.050 --> 00:11:57.520
I didn't see anything.

00:11:58.390 --> 00:12:00.320
I definitely saw a flash!

00:12:00.530 --> 00:12:03.190
Oh, be quiet!
I told you it's nothing.

00:12:03.260 --> 00:12:05.860
If you don't shut up,
I'll throw you out ofthe dorm!

00:12:05.930 --> 00:12:08.090
We have no choice.
Let's go back for now.

00:12:14.240 --> 00:12:16.870
What are you doing?!
You made them suspicious!

00:12:18.880 --> 00:12:20.240
<i>There's no other way.</i>

00:12:20.310 --> 00:12:22.580
We're stepping up the plan.
It's going down tonight!

00:12:26.480 --> 00:12:27.540
Okay, let's go.

00:12:27.620 --> 00:12:32.420
Right! I'm glad I made this
for just such an emergency!

00:12:44.970 --> 00:12:47.440
<i>So this is a girl's room...</i>

00:12:49.940 --> 00:12:53.070
I'm sorry to keep
you waiting, Ukiya.

00:12:53.310 --> 00:12:55.080
O- Oh, that's okay.

00:12:59.280 --> 00:13:01.910
It- It's wrong!
We're still only high school kids!

00:13:01.990 --> 00:13:04.280
Here! Dig in!

00:13:06.820 --> 00:13:09.560
You must be hungry.
N- No...

00:13:09.630 --> 00:13:12.060
There's no need to hold back.
-Th- Thanks.

00:13:12.130 --> 00:13:15.100
I wasn't able to obtain
anything but junk food, but...

00:13:15.930 --> 00:13:17.930
...actually, I was
really hungry myselfl

00:13:18.970 --> 00:13:20.560
Help yourself, Ukiya.

00:13:20.640 --> 00:13:22.200
I will, thanks!

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:29.110
U- Uki...
Y- You guys!

00:13:30.650 --> 00:13:31.910
It's Kaoru!

00:13:31.980 --> 00:13:33.610
This is bad!

00:13:34.020 --> 00:13:35.320
What's wrong, Kao...

00:13:35.950 --> 00:13:38.580
Bancho... Megane... and...

00:13:39.320 --> 00:13:40.720
Ukiya!

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:43.390
Rurippe! You're wrong!
I can explain...

00:13:50.370 --> 00:13:56.330
Honestly! Gate Keeper members illegally
trespassing?! You're a thorough disgrace!

00:13:56.410 --> 00:13:58.210
Uh, no... You see...
You see, uh...

00:13:58.540 --> 00:14:00.410
Dirty pervert, thug, low lifes!

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:01.950
Completely.

00:14:02.510 --> 00:14:04.680
It's a misunderstanding,
Princess Ruriko!

00:14:04.750 --> 00:14:07.340
It was temporary insanity!

00:14:07.650 --> 00:14:11.280
It's not like they meant any
harm, so why don't you forgive...

00:14:11.360 --> 00:14:12.850
Ukiya!
Yes?

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:23.360
<i>I can no longer depend on anyone.
It's up to me!</i>

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:38.610
I called.
Rurippe sure is taking a long time.

00:14:38.680 --> 00:14:41.410
Maybe someone should have
gone with her after all.

00:14:43.720 --> 00:14:46.990
Speak of the devil!
So, how was Room 104?

00:14:51.260 --> 00:14:53.390
Hey, wait up, Rurippe.

00:14:53.460 --> 00:14:55.130
What's wrong with you?

00:14:55.200 --> 00:14:56.760
Huh? What do you mean?

00:14:57.670 --> 00:15:00.640
Rurippe, what happened in Room 104?!

00:15:01.410 --> 00:15:04.170
Nothing! I should
be going to bed now!

00:15:04.410 --> 00:15:06.640
Go to bed?!
It's not even 9 o'clock.

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:09.310
But I'm going to bed anyway!!
Good night.

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:10.850
Hey!

00:15:12.350 --> 00:15:15.220
What was that all about?
Did I say something to upset her?

00:15:15.490 --> 00:15:18.620
She's not acting herself.
She's awfully nervous.

00:15:18.690 --> 00:15:21.160
It's almost as if she
were a different person!

00:15:21.460 --> 00:15:23.990
She really might be
a different person.

00:15:25.130 --> 00:15:28.570
In a movie I saw a while ago,
invaders switched places...

00:15:28.630 --> 00:15:32.370
...with humans and
infiltrated human society.

00:15:32.600 --> 00:15:34.040
Do you think they got Rurippe?!

00:15:34.110 --> 00:15:35.630
Oh, my! That's horrible!

00:15:35.710 --> 00:15:37.470
What should we do, Ukiya?

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:39.530
Rurippe... I'll...

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:42.740
It's unwise to draw attention
to ourselves right now!

00:15:42.810 --> 00:15:45.580
Now that lkusawa is
in their clutches...

00:15:45.650 --> 00:15:47.910
...we must act with caution!

00:15:48.450 --> 00:15:49.890
But what should we do?

00:15:49.950 --> 00:15:51.220
For starters...

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:55.820
...l'll go out to reconnoiter!
lf by any chance l don't return...

00:15:56.090 --> 00:15:59.160
...Ukiya, the rest is in your hands.

00:15:59.230 --> 00:16:01.320
Understood.
Megane...

00:16:08.140 --> 00:16:10.110
Brrrr...

00:16:10.840 --> 00:16:12.900
I got this far by acting
all big and authoritive...

00:16:12.980 --> 00:16:15.210
...but now that I'm here,
it's really scary!

00:16:19.520 --> 00:16:23.850
I'll never be captain if something
this minor rattles me. Here goes!

00:16:24.520 --> 00:16:26.490
<i>I knew you would come.</i>

00:16:29.330 --> 00:16:31.850
lkusawa...!

00:16:37.870 --> 00:16:39.770
<i>Come on in.</i>

00:16:39.840 --> 00:16:42.500
<i>You are now one of us.</i>

00:16:45.440 --> 00:16:47.410
NO!

00:16:49.480 --> 00:16:50.970
That's Megane!

00:16:52.120 --> 00:16:55.520
Kaoru, Reiko! Evacuate the
other girls from the building!

00:16:55.590 --> 00:16:56.780
Yes!

00:16:56.850 --> 00:16:58.580
Stay on your toes, Bancho.

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:00.060
Gotcha!

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:03.150
We appear to be in
the midst of the enemy!

00:17:03.230 --> 00:17:04.490
Yeah.

00:17:04.560 --> 00:17:06.330
Ukiya! Ukiya!

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:07.590
What's wrong, Kaoru?

00:17:07.670 --> 00:17:09.100
Th- They're gone!

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:12.360
They're all gone! Every room
in the building is empty!

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:24.310
What should we do now, Ukiya?

00:17:25.950 --> 00:17:27.380
Let's go!

00:17:27.450 --> 00:17:29.480
Go? Do you mean...?

00:17:29.550 --> 00:17:31.680
To Room 104, of course!

00:17:32.060 --> 00:17:34.890
I'm going with you!
Me, too!

00:17:36.530 --> 00:17:40.590
I'm going, too! I don't
wanna be left behind!!

00:17:45.570 --> 00:17:47.800
Everyone stick together
and don't wander off.

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:49.340
Right!

00:17:58.380 --> 00:17:59.510
Everyone's here, right?

00:17:59.580 --> 00:18:01.020
Present!
Present.

00:18:01.090 --> 00:18:02.550
Where's Reiko?!

00:18:02.620 --> 00:18:04.090
What?!

00:18:06.620 --> 00:18:10.220
That can't be! I never
even noticed! What now?

00:18:13.700 --> 00:18:15.500
We'll have to proceed without her.

00:18:21.640 --> 00:18:23.610
That's the room, right?
Yeah.

00:18:37.260 --> 00:18:38.880
We're finally here.

00:18:40.690 --> 00:18:42.160
What's wrong?!

00:18:42.230 --> 00:18:44.990
Now they've got Princess Kaorul!

00:18:46.900 --> 00:18:49.090
LET'S GO, BANCHO!

00:18:49.170 --> 00:18:51.640
We will wage their avenging battlel!

00:18:51.700 --> 00:18:52.900
Right!

00:18:52.970 --> 00:18:56.000
GATE OPEN!

00:19:08.650 --> 00:19:10.180
Is it an ambush!?

00:19:10.990 --> 00:19:12.510
Welcome!

00:19:12.590 --> 00:19:15.750
Welcome to Tategami High!
And welcome to Sumire Dormitory!

00:19:18.700 --> 00:19:21.690
That's not Reiko and Kaoru!
Hey! Those are boys!!

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:24.670
What are they doing here?!
You're getting it all wrong...

00:19:24.740 --> 00:19:27.300
Someone go call the guard!
Ukiya, I'm frightened!

00:19:27.370 --> 00:19:28.600
Ukiya!

00:19:28.670 --> 00:19:30.200
Rurippe?!

00:19:30.270 --> 00:19:32.710
Honestly! You wrecked the party!

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:35.210
Par......ty?

00:19:35.810 --> 00:19:37.680
CHEERS!

00:19:37.750 --> 00:19:40.550
This is the traditional
Sumire Dorm welcoming party!

00:19:40.850 --> 00:19:45.550
It's a surprise party we put together
in secret to surprise newcomers.

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:49.490
They say this helps to cement
friendships between dorm mates.

00:19:49.560 --> 00:19:51.650
You mean Kaoru and Reiko
sensed a presence...

00:19:51.730 --> 00:19:54.060
...and were told about a room
that mustn't be opened because...

00:19:54.130 --> 00:19:58.660
That's right. We did it so they
wouldn't find out about the party.

00:19:58.740 --> 00:20:03.640
Now, let's do this over! Miss Asagiri,
Miss Konoe! Welcome to our dormitory!

00:20:03.710 --> 00:20:05.900
Welcome to Sumire Dorm!

00:20:09.450 --> 00:20:10.970
It's wonderful!

00:20:11.050 --> 00:20:13.350
Really! It's very pretty.

00:20:13.620 --> 00:20:16.090
Welcome!
Thankyou so much!

00:20:16.150 --> 00:20:18.350
Dorm life is like
living in a big family.

00:20:18.420 --> 00:20:20.020
Let's have a good time.
I'm pleased to meet you!

00:20:20.090 --> 00:20:23.760
They're lucky. Now I want
to try out dorm life!

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:27.290
Who the hell said this
was the work of invaders?!

00:20:27.370 --> 00:20:29.460
Forgive me!

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:31.490
Megane!

00:20:32.900 --> 00:20:34.670
Hi...

00:20:35.340 --> 00:20:38.370
I explained it to Megane
and got his cooperation.

00:20:38.440 --> 00:20:40.910
Then how come you
wouldn't let me in on it?!

00:20:41.050 --> 00:20:45.040
If l had told you, Kaoru and
Reiko would have found out.

00:20:45.120 --> 00:20:46.410
HOW?

00:20:46.480 --> 00:20:48.650
You're not clever enough
to keep a straight face.

00:20:49.820 --> 00:20:51.720
But you still went too far!

00:20:51.790 --> 00:20:54.380
First you, then Megane...
Reiko, then Kaoru...

00:20:54.460 --> 00:20:58.360
You went missing one after the next.
Do you have any idea how l felt?!

00:20:58.430 --> 00:20:59.920
Ukiya...

00:21:00.460 --> 00:21:03.060
UKIYA-2  KUSAWA-2 MEGANE-1

00:21:03.430 --> 00:21:04.900
Now it's a tie.

00:21:04.970 --> 00:21:06.870
The last vote will decide it.

00:21:06.940 --> 00:21:08.230
UKIYA3  KUSAWA-2

00:21:08.310 --> 00:21:10.070
All right!

00:21:10.140 --> 00:21:12.630
Me? I'm the captain?!

00:21:12.710 --> 00:21:14.740
We're counting on you,
Captain Ukiya!

00:21:15.110 --> 00:21:16.980
Roger, AEGIS!

00:21:21.450 --> 00:21:22.720
Thank you.

00:21:22.790 --> 00:21:26.820
<i>Wait a minute! There's Kaoru, me...
who cast the remaining vote?</i>

00:21:26.890 --> 00:21:28.450
I get it!

00:21:28.530 --> 00:21:31.760
Thanks, Bancho! I'm grateful
for friendship among men!

00:21:31.830 --> 00:21:33.730
Friendship?

00:21:33.800 --> 00:21:36.930
I'm sorry. I... cast my
vote for Princess Ruriko.

00:21:37.000 --> 00:21:39.100
Huh? But that would mean...

00:22:04.530 --> 00:22:08.230
<i>Itsumademo wasurenai
We received many things</i>

00:22:08.230 --> 00:22:12.100
<i>takusan no mono moratta ne.
we will never forget.</i>

00:22:12.200 --> 00:22:17.070
<i>Sora no iro utsushite hikaru
I don't mean the blue jewels flashing</i>

00:22:17.610 --> 00:22:20.440
<i>aoi houseki ya
with colors of the sky...</i>

00:22:20.440 --> 00:22:22.580
koinu-tachi
or a big yard

00:22:22.580 --> 00:22:27.750
<i>hanemawaru hiroi</i> niwaja <i>nai,
with puppies romping around,</i>

00:22:27.750 --> 00:22:31.090
motto motto daijina
but something <i>much</i> more

00:22:31.090 --> 00:22:35.720
<i>mono wo.
important.</i>

00:22:36.420 --> 00:22:40.590
<i>Kinou Kara kyou e
From yesterday to today,</i>

00:22:40.660 --> 00:22:45.220
<i>kyou kara asu e to
from today to tomorrow,</i>

00:22:45.700 --> 00:22:52.000
boku-tachi wa aruite yuku yo.
we will walk toward the future.
